From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:27:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] system: add a rom settings screen

there is no place for rom specific toggles, so add a rom settings entry
above play integrity under system.

it holds a switch for window_ignore_secure, so screenshots work in
FLAG_SECURE apps, and a sound pack list that points the default
ringtone, notification, alarm and ui sounds at the lineage or samsung
files.
